# LSan suppressions for ci/leak-check.sh.
#
# Frame match at any depth. Broad entries (whole lib, event loop) hide our leaks
# too. Only functions never calling our code.
#
# Qt 5.15 (Ubuntu), all workspace tests. None ours.

# Offscreen platform: screens, cursor made at startup, never freed, cyclic.
# Qt's, once per process.
leak:QGuiApplicationPrivate::createPlatformIntegration

# QML connections to that screen (`Screen` attached property, window watching
# it). Live in leaked list.
leak:QQuickScreenInfo::setWrappedScreen
leak:QQuickWindowPrivate::init
